But one issue: the client `tsconfig.json` has `moduleResolution: bundler` and `allowImportingTsExtensions: true`. The imports use `.tsx`? Actually existing files use `.ts` without extension. E.g., `client/src/main.tsx` imports `./App.tsx`. So I should be careful. The `stores/auth.ts` imports `zustand` without path. New files can import with `@/` aliases.

